超级痛
Really painful!

171
00:08:17,540 --> 00:08:19,460
地板上是有突出的钉子之类的吗
Is there a nail sticking up through the floor?

172
00:08:20,460 --> 00:08:23,020
惨了 他踩到钉子·帕特里克·哈里斯
Oh no, he stepped on Nail Patrick Harris!

173
00:08:23,880 --> 00:08:26,460
我忘了警告你有钉子了
Oh, I forgot to warn you about that stupid nail.

174
00:08:26,680 --> 00:08:28,900
在那里很久了 我都习惯自动避开了
It's been there forever. I just know to avoid it by now.

175
00:08:28,960 --> 00:08:30,940
大家都是啊 所以我们才叫他
Everyone does; that's why we named it

176
00:08:30,940 --> 00:08:31,760
"钉子"·帕特里克·哈里斯
"Nail Patrick Harris."

177
00:08:32,200 --> 00:08:33,100
你没事吧
Are you okay?

178
00:08:33,540 --> 00:08:35,140
你看起来好像很痛啊
You look like you're in a lot of pain.

179
00:08:35,320 --> 00:08:36,240
你想碰碰运气
Do you want to roll the dice

180
00:08:36,240 --> 00:08:37,340
吃一颗从沙发里挖出来的随机药丸吗
with one of the pills in the couch?

181
00:08:37,560 --> 00:08:38,860
我没事 没这么严重啦
I'm fine. It's not that bad.

182
00:08:39,280 --> 00:08:40,720
把你的脚举起来 我看看伤口
Okay, well lift up your foot. Let me see.

183
00:08:42,120 --> 00:08:52,360
天啊 天啊 天啊
Oh, my God, oh, my God, oh, my God!

184
00:08:53,980 --> 00:08:54,460
兰迪
Randy?

185
00:08:55,060 --> 00:08:56,200
这严重了吧
This is bad.

186
00:08:57,380 --> 00:08:59,460
我们得带你去医淤安院看看
I think we have to take you to Hapitalito.

187
00:09:01,020 --> 00:09:02,660
我一定是要失去意识了
Well, I must be losing consciousness.

188
00:09:03,180 --> 00:09:03,960
你的话我听起来像胡言乱语
That sounded like gibberish.

189
00:09:04,240 --> 00:09:06,160
没 你没听错 真的就是医淤安院
No, you heard me right, I said Hapitalito.

190
00:09:06,440 --> 00:09:07,620
那是我们的医疗保险提供者
That's our healthcare provider.

191
00:09:07,780 --> 00:09:09,280
是一个推着一推车邦迪的人
It's a guy with a shopping cart filled with Band-Aids,

192
00:09:09,600 --> 00:09:10,740
而且里面大部分都是没用过的好货呢
and most of them aren't used.

193
00:09:10,740 --> 00:09:13,040
麦克斯 我有医保
Max, I have insurance.

194
00:09:13,440 --> 00:09:14,940
我觉得他那边不接受医疗保险
Well, I don't think he takes insurance,

195
00:09:15,320 --> 00:09:17,700
如果你有旧的冻酸奶店的卡
but if you have old TCBY cards,

196
00:09:17,860 --> 00:09:19,020
五张可以换"一次手术"呢
five is good for "Uno surgeria."

197
00:09:20,560 --> 00:09:21,820
可能止血了
Well, maybe it stopped.

198
00:09:28,569 --> 00:09:32,947
我是嘉丽 被泼了猪血的嘉丽
I'm Carrie! I'm Carrie at the prom!

199
00:09:33,500 --> 00:09:35,400
卡洛琳 好啦 我们得去医院了
Caroline, come on, we have to go.

200
00:09:35,860 --> 00:09:38,180
我已经浑身是血了 就让我自己死去吧
I'm already covered in blood. Just leave me to die.

201
00:09:38,660 --> 00:09:40,060
冷静点好吗
Oh, calm down!

202
00:09:40,060 --> 00:09:42,660
如果是我平常约会的那个等级的男人
If this had happened with any of my regular type of guys,

203
00:09:42,700 --> 00:09:44,620
你现在已经差不多得丙肝了
you'd be halfway to Hep C right now.

204
00:09:47,500 --> 00:09:48,700
救人啊 救人啦
Help! Help!

205
00:09:49,060 --> 00:09:51,000
我的公寓想谋杀我男朋友
My apartment tried to kill my boyfriend!

206
00:09:51,060 --> 00:09:52,000
他要死了
He's gonna die!

207
00:09:52,180 --> 00:09:54,040
我不会死的 麦克斯
I'm not gonna die, Max.

208
00:09:54,300 --> 00:09:56,340
不过我被你用药房塑料袋绑住的脚
Although, this CVS bag you tied around my foot

209
00:09:56,340 --> 00:09:57,600
勒太近完全影响我的血液循环
has completely cut off the circulation.

210
00:09:58,460 --> 00:10:00,360
而且袋子里那3米长的收据要跑进伤口了
And the ten-foot receipt's caught in the wound.

211
00:10:02,700 --> 00:10:04,840
我的男朋友需要接受治疗
My boyfriend needs medical attention.

212
00:10:05,340 --> 00:10:06,200
是咩
Oh, really?

213
00:10:06,420 --> 00:10:08,920
我还以为他来是想买一套看起来精明干练
I thought he was here for a sensible pantsuit

214
00:10:08,920 --> 00:10:10,420
价钱又合理的裤装的呢
at a reasonable price.

215
00:10:11,534 --> 00:10:14,066
我认得你
Oh, I recognize you

216
00:10:14,640 --> 00:10:16,060
我们上次来这里时你也在[第1季第16集]
from the last time we were in here.

217
00:10:16,340 --> 00:10:17,520
我当时就不被你外表所吸引
I wasn't attracted to you then,

218
00:10:17,520 --> 00:10:19,948
你这一次还加入了秃顶跟大胡子呢
but I see you've added balding and a beard to the mix.

219
00:10:19,948 --> 00:10:23,140
呵呵 我也记得你呢
Ha, ha, I remember you too.

220
00:10:23,140 --> 00:10:24,760
穿着超市货的恶魔
The devil wears Target.

221
00:10:25,960 --> 00:10:27,720
我们需要好医生
We need a good doctor,

222
00:10:27,720 --> 00:10:29,580
所以最好不是来自美洲的医生
so he better not be from America.

223
00:10:31,460 --> 00:10:32,600
他可是有医疗保险的人
'Cause he has insurance.

224
00:10:32,940 --> 00:10:33,780
兰迪 把医保卡给他看
Show him the card, Randy.

225
00:10:35,060 --> 00:10:36,600
我能摸一下吗
Could I touch it?

226
00:10:39,620 --> 00:10:41,760
不错啊 医疗保险是好的那种呢
Oh, good for you, a PPO.

227
00:10:42,340 --> 00:10:44,640
就那块 我也清理过"屎"好的那种
You know, I cleaned up some PPO right there.

228
00:10:45,960 --> 00:10:47,700
别闹了 这很严重
Come on, this is serious!

229
00:10:47,800 --> 00:10:48,940
他可能会感染"俄方块"呢
He might have "Tetris"!

230
00:10:50,140 --> 00:10:53,400
他得了受人喜爱的俄罗斯方块游戏吗
He's got the beloved Russian puzzle game?

231
00:10:54,340 --> 00:10:56,200
你确定他染上的不是
Are you sure he doesn't have a case of the

232
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:57,520
超级马里奥兄弟吗
Super Mario Brothers?

233
00:10:59,100 --> 00:11:01,100
前面还排有很多人呢
Well, there's a lot of people ahead of you,

234
00:11:01,120 --> 00:11:03,100
麻烦你带着你男人与他的小伤伤
so why don't you take your boyfriend's boo boo

235
00:11:03,100 --> 00:11:04,000
去那边坐下
and sit down?

236
00:11:05,300 --> 00:11:05,820
行
Fine.

237
00:11:06,140 --> 00:11:08,840
但他最好没死 因为要是他死了
But he better not die, 'cause if he does,

238
00:11:09,060 --> 00:11:10,160
我要把你的那些别章
I'm gonna take those buttons

239
00:11:10,160 --> 00:11:11,520
统统别到你蛋蛋上
and pin them to your sack.

240
00:11:13,460 --> 00:11:13,740
不许反悔哦
Promise?

241
00:11:15,768 --> 00:11:17,181
靠
Damn it!

242
00:11:17,760 --> 00:11:19,580
我们估计要在这等一辈子了
I guess we're gonna be here forever.

243
00:11:20,120 --> 00:11:22,680
就跟等卡洛琳洗澡的时间一样长
The exact amount of time Caroline's shower took.

244
00:11:23,800 --> 00:11:25,320
所以你男人像演血腥片
Oh, so it's my fault your boyfriend

245
00:11:25,320 --> 00:11:27,060
喷了我一身血 也怨我吗
Freddy Krueger-ed all over me?

246
00:11:28,380 --> 00:11:30,120
卡洛琳 真的很抱歉
Caroline, I am so sorry.

247
00:11:30,400 --> 00:11:31,360
没关系 兰迪
That's okay, Randy.

248
00:11:31,640 --> 00:11:32,920
你可以补偿我
You can make it up to me.

249
00:11:32,960 --> 00:11:33,560
就现在吧
Right now!

250
00:11:33,720 --> 00:11:36,380
我刚好拿着酒水供应许可证的申请表
I just so happen to have our liquor license application,

251
00:11:36,380 --> 00:11:37,380
你要不要帮忙看一下
if you want to take a look-see.

252
00:11:38,380 --> 00:11:41,260
你要不要也别在那个白化猪的蛋蛋上啊 卡洛琳
Do you also want to be pinned to that albino's sack, Caroline?

253
00:11:44,760 --> 00:11:46,060
伤者要来了
Okay, coming through.

254
00:11:46,400 --> 00:11:47,960
我先帮你清出一条道
Okay, let me clear a path.

255
00:11:50,840 --> 00:11:52,920
现在我知道我桃乐茜奶奶是什么感觉了
Now I know how my grandma Dorothy felt.

256
00:11:54,760 --> 00:11:56,120
太好了 你回来了
Oh, good, you're back.

257
00:11:56,260 --> 00:11:57,260
兰迪 你还好吗
Randy, are you okay?

258
00:11:57,480 --> 00:11:58,440
还好
Oh, I'm fine.

259
00:11:58,780 --> 00:12:00,380
你离开急诊室后 我买了点东西
Did some shopping after you left the ER.

260
00:12:01,020 --> 00:12:02,040
喜欢我的新袋子吗
Like my new bag?

261
00:12:04,540 --> 00:12:06,020
如果你需要手拿包来搭配
If you need a clutch to match,

262
00:12:06,020 --> 00:12:07,860
我有款式类似的塑料密封袋哟
I have something similar in Ziploc.

263
00:12:09,440 --> 00:12:11,300
因为那颗钉子生锈了
Because the nail was rusted

264
00:12:11,300 --> 00:12:13,120
他的伤口又碰到我们的地板
and the open wound touched our floor,

265
00:12:13,200 --> 00:12:15,200
医院给兰迪开了抗生素点滴
they gave Randy an IV of antibiotics.

266
00:12:15,500 --> 00:12:18,020
却连一片止痛药都不给姐们儿
And not even a whisper of Vicodin for old Maxie.

267
00:12:19,580 --> 00:12:21,440
麦克斯 我们总得有一个人去工作
Well, Max, one of us has to go to work

268
00:12:21,440 --> 00:12:22,980
然后假装两个人都在那
and pretend both of us are there.

269
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:24,600
那肯定是你去啦
Well, it's gonna have to be you.

270
00:12:24,640 --> 00:12:25,840
我不能把兰迪扔在这里
I can't leave Randy here.

271
00:12:26,080 --> 00:12:28,520
这里像闹鬼的屋子 危险可是真实存在的啊
It's like a haunted house, but the dangers are real.

272
00:12:29,820 --> 00:12:31,920
麦克斯 你去工作吧
Max, you're going to work.

273
00:12:32,140 --> 00:12:33,480
我自己在这没事
I'll be fine here.

274
00:12:33,480 --> 00:12:35,700
我曾跟西恩·潘分时使用过同一套度假屋
I had a time-share with Sean Penn.

275
00:12:38,720 --> 00:12:40,660
我哪儿也不去
I'm not going anywhere.

276
00:12:40,900 --> 00:12:43,000
是我不好 害你在我家被"搞"成这样
It's my fault you got nailed in my apartment,

277
00:12:43,000 --> 00:12:44,760
我要留在这里保护你
and I'm staying here to protect you.

278
00:12:46,080 --> 00:12:47,680
你得去工作
You're going to work.

279
00:12:47,800 --> 00:12:48,980
我一个人没事
I'll be okay.

280
00:12:49,400 --> 00:12:51,020
你担心的样子真的好可爱
But you're very cute when you're worried.

281
00:12:51,360 --> 00:12:53,580
就像你以为酒店没有卡通台那时一样
Like when you thought the hotel didn't get Cartoon Network.

282
00:12:54,940 --> 00:12:56,080
好吧 我去
All right, fine.

283
00:12:56,560 --> 00:12:58,540
但如果你要我回来 一定打给我哦
But call me if you need me to come back.

284
00:12:58,600 --> 00:13:00,800
我会跟阿憨说 我在家上班
I'll tell Han I'm working the rest of my shift from home.

285
00:13:04,400 --> 00:13:05,260
天啊
Oh, my God!

286
00:13:05,620 --> 00:13:07,060
我刚想起我没告诉兰迪
I just remembered I didn't tell Randy

287
00:13:07,060 --> 00:13:08,620
我房间有个坑
about the pothole in my bedroom.

288
00:13:09,800 --> 00:13:10,600
麦克斯 别紧张
Max, relax.

289
00:13:10,660 --> 00:13:11,880
我好久没看你这么紧张了
I haven't seen you this anxious

290
00:13:11,880 --> 00:13:13,940
上次是因为你看不了外送披萨的进度
since the Dominos pizza tracker went down.

291
00:13:14,340 --> 00:13:15,120
听着 妹子
Look, woman!

292
00:13:15,380 --> 00:13:17,660
兰迪来纽约是为了看看我们有没有戏
Randy came to New York to see if our relationship could work,

293
00:13:17,780 --> 00:13:19,220
但我们压根不该离开酒店
but we never should have left that hotel.

294
00:13:19,520 --> 00:13:21,460
就像当你去赌城 离开繁华的长街
It's like when you go to Vegas and wander off the Strip

295
00:13:21,460 --> 00:13:23,240
最终来到了居民区一样
and wind up in a residential neighborhood.

296
00:13:23,400 --> 00:13:24,740
你绝对缓不过劲来
You can't come back from that.

297
00:13:25,380 --> 00:13:27,280
结果我就这样在某人的棚子里住了两年
It's how I wound up living two years in someone's shed.

298
00:13:28,700 --> 00:13:30,920
看来我早上发的激励内刊
I suppose the motivational newsletter

299
00:13:30,920 --> 00:13:33,020
没有起到任何作用
I sent out this morning didn't do any good.

300
00:13:33,020 --> 00:13:34,861
我甚至不知道我干嘛费劲出版
I don't even know why I bother publishing

301
00:13:34,861 --> 00:13:37,552
《餐厅小事我"憨"你》
What's Going Han?

302
00:13:37,960 --> 00:13:40,560
我喜欢那只胖松鼠的连环漫画
I like the comic strip about the fat squirrel.

303
00:13:41,180 --> 00:13:42,580
那画上的是我
That picture was me!

304
00:13:43,620 --> 00:13:45,340
不可能是你 人家有松果[蛋蛋]
It can't be you; he had nuts.

305
00:13:47,200 --> 00:13:49,440
四号桌的女士点餐好久了
And that lady at table four ordered

306
00:13:49,440 --> 00:13:52,420
她连上衣都织好穿上了 你们还没上菜
before she started knitting that sweater she's now wearing.

307
00:13:56,360 --> 00:13:57,580
太好了 是兰迪
Oh, good, it's Randy.

308
00:13:58,440 --> 00:13:59,560
我忘了告诉你了
Hey, I forgot to tell you,

309
00:13:59,580 --> 00:14:01,560
冲完马桶五分钟内
you can't drink the tap water within five minutes

310
00:14:01,560 --> 00:14:02,580
不能喝自来水
after flushing the toilet.

311
00:14:03,200 --> 00:14:04,940
你能自己催吐吗
Well, can you make yourself throw up?

312
00:14:06,377 --> 00:14:09,496
上菜 早餐玉米饼卷
Pickup: breakfast burrito.

313
00:14:10,540 --> 00:14:12,020
兰迪打给我们的房东
Randy called our landlord

314
00:14:12,020 --> 00:14:13,799
投诉钉子·帕特里克·哈里斯
to complain about Nail Patrick Harris!

315
00:14:13,799 --> 00:14:17,305
我宁愿看他主持 也不愿看瑞奇·热维斯主持
I'd rather see him host something than Ricky Gervais.

316
00:14:17,640 --> 00:14:20,100
我们知道 你最毒舌啦 你个死胖子
We get it: you're mean, you fat bastard.

317
00:14:20,800 --> 00:14:22,540
兰迪居然打给房东了
Randy called the landlord?

318
00:14:22,800 --> 00:14:24,440
但我们是非法转租客
But we're illegal subletters!

319
00:14:24,580 --> 00:14:26,020
我们是非法占用者
We're squatters there!

320
00:14:26,200 --> 00:14:27,440
对于大部分厕所也是
And over most toilets.

321
00:14:28,000 --> 00:14:29,920
走吧 卡洛琳 我们得赶在房东到之前
Come on, Caroline, we have to get to the apartment

322
00:14:29,920 --> 00:14:31,080
回到公寓
before the landlord does.

323
00:14:32,280 --> 00:14:33,140
你们要走了吗
You're leaving?

324
00:14:33,560 --> 00:14:35,900
中了大乐透的那个公路收费员
The tollbooth operator who won Powerball

325
00:14:35,900 --> 00:14:37,360
在岗位上坚持的时间比你们更久
stayed at their job longer.

326
00:14:40,347 --> 00:14:42,480
兰迪 我们得赶紧跑路
Randy, we got to go!

327
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:44,480
我来打包东西 你给栗宝装上马鞍
I'll start packing! You saddle up Chestnut.

328
00:14:44,880 --> 00:14:46,540
好的 我懂规矩 一双鞋
Yeah, I know the drill: one pair of shoes,

329
00:14:46,620 --> 00:14:47,780
一些你可以背着的东西
something you can carry on your back,

330
00:14:47,800 --> 00:14:49,000
一顶遮阳帽 以防危地马拉的...
and a sun hat for Guatemala--

331
00:14:49,240 --> 00:14:50,940
我是说 无论去哪里啦
I mean, wherever we're headed.

332
00:14:52,800 --> 00:14:55,320
兰迪 你最好把剩下这点点滴喝掉
Randy, you better drink up the rest of the that IV fluid,

333
00:14:55,520 --> 00:14:57,260
因为拖着那玩意跑路 会跑不快
'cause carrying that around is just gonna slow us down.

334
00:14:57,480 --> 00:14:58,800
麦克斯 你这是干什么
Max, what in the hell is going on?

335
00:14:58,800 --> 00:14:59,800
干嘛一惊一乍的
Why are you freaking out?

336
00:14:59,800 --> 00:15:01,780
我打给房东投诉钉子
I called the landlord about a nail,

337
00:15:01,860 --> 00:15:03,555
又不是打给联邦调查局举报你的护照
not the FBI about your passport...

338
00:15:03,555 --> 00:15:06,502
弗兰克·德莱波特
Frank Delaport.

339
00:15:06,860 --> 00:15:08,980
兰迪 我们的名字不在这房子的租约上
Randy, we're not on the lease to this apartment.

340
00:15:11,740 --> 00:15:12,840
好了 我准备好了
Okay, I'm ready.

341
00:15:12,900 --> 00:15:14,840
我需要十分钟 来给栗宝装上马鞍
I just need ten minutes to saddle up Chestnut.

342
